This repository is an npm workspaces monorepo containing multiple packages
under different licenses. There is no single license that covers the
repository as a whole — each package's own LICENSE file is authoritative for
that package's code:

- `packages/tsl_array_n` — MIT License, see `packages/tsl_array_n/LICENSE`
- `packages/fluxflow` — Apache License 2.0, see `packages/fluxflow/LICENSE`

Third-party dependency notices are likewise tracked per package, in each
package's own `THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md`.
